{"step_index":1783,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-23T13:08:44Z","content":"### 🚀 ValuTeachers Priority Tier & Named Campaign Lists Implemented!\n\nWe have combined **Strategy 1 (Priority Tier Weighting)** and **Strategy 2 (Named Lists)** so you can snap in older lead cards without disrupting your fresh calling queue.\n\n---\n\n### 🌟 What Was Built:\n\n1. **Card Scan Review & Ingestion ([`ScanSheetScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/ScanSheetScreen.tsx)):**\n   - **1-Tap Priority Toggle:**\n     - 🟢 **Fresh / Hot Lead (`Tier 1` - Default):** Prioritized at the front of the calling queue.\n     - 🏛️ **Legacy / Archive (`Tier 3`):** Positioned at the very back of the calling queue.\n   - **Target List Destination:** Assign scanned cards directly to *Master Pipeline*, an existing list, or create a brand new list on the fly with **+ New List** (e.g., *\"2023–2024 Legacy Vault\"*).\n\n2. **Smart Queue Ordering ([`leadsRepository.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/db/leadsRepository.ts), [`database.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/db/database.ts)):**\n   - The queue sorting query now enforces:\n     ```sql\n     ORDER BY priority_tier ASC, attempts_count ASC, created_at ASC\n     ```\n   - **The Result:** All `Tier 1` fresh leads are dialed first. Legacy leads (`Tier 3`) will only be surfaced once active leads have been worked through.\n\n3. **Dashboard & Pipeline View ([`ListsScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/ListsScreen.tsx)):**\n   - **Campaign & Tier Filter Chips:** Filter your pipeline by *All Campaigns*, custom lists, *Fresh Only*, or *Legacy Only*.\n   - **Visual Badges:** Every educator card displays a `🔥 Fresh` or `🏛️ Legacy` tag.\n\n4. **Profile & Power Dialer HUD ([`LeadDetailScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/LeadDetailScreen.tsx), [`DialerHudScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx)):**\n   - **1-Tap Quick Switch:** Toggle any contact between Fresh and Legacy with 1 click in their profile.\n   - **HUD Age Context:** The top ribbon clearly displays `🔥 FRESH PRIORITY` or `🏛️ LEGACY LEAD` next to the attempt badge.\n\n---\n\n### 🌐 Live Deployment\nThe updated build has been compiled and deployed to:\n👉 **[https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh](https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh)**"}
